WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.310
(light melodic music)

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:05.320
- [Narrator] In beautiful County Clare

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:07.710
in the verdant southwest of Ireland,

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:12.440
there is a man, a farmer, a local legend,

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:15.579
a man who provides a very special service.

00:00:15.579 --> 00:00:18.653
- That woman wants someone
that looks like Donald Trump.

00:00:19.501 --> 00:00:20.334
(laughing)

00:00:20.334 --> 00:00:22.573
- [Narrator] Like I said, it's special.

00:00:23.838 --> 00:00:28.511
- [Announcer] This "Great Big
Story" is inspired by Genesis.

00:00:28.511 --> 00:00:31.928
(cheerful melodic music)

00:00:35.162 --> 00:00:37.780
- [Narrator] Matchmakers
have been helping couples

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:39.674
in Ireland since ancient times

00:00:39.674 --> 00:00:42.860
and this guy is one of the last.

00:02:33.981 --> 00:02:38.981
♪ I went into an ale
house I used to frequent ♪

00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:41.612
- [Narrator] Today the
matchmaking tradition has evolved,

00:02:41.612 --> 00:02:45.147
many matches are made at a
festival in nearby Lisdoonvarna;

00:02:45.147 --> 00:02:48.300
every year the festival
attracts thousands of people

00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:52.860
and lasts 24 days; Willie is
at the heart of the event,

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:55.799
and to him, human contact is everything.

00:02:55.799 --> 00:02:56.725
- Oh!
- Let's do it!

00:02:56.725 --> 00:02:57.892
- Let's do it.

00:03:10.369 --> 00:03:12.560
- [Narrator] This is
Willie's daughter, Elisha;

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:14.810
she's a matchmaker as well.

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:30.417
♪ No never no more ♪

00:03:30.417 --> 00:03:32.917
- That's the "Wild Rover" now.

00:04:04.548 --> 00:04:07.965
(cheerful melodic music)

